  "ingredients": [
    "2.25 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 tablespoon baking powder",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground nutmeg",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground ginger",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cloves",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground allspice",
    "0.5 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup white sugar",
    "0.5 cup butter, softened",
    "0.33333334326744 cup brown sugar",
    "2 large eggs, room temperature",
    "1 cup pumpkin puree",
    "0.75 cup milk",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese, softened",
    "0.25 cup butter, softened",
    "3 cups confectioners' sugar",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Grease 24 muffin cups or line cups with paper liners.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/C8OuSnupSXFnqfvWs7RZMjSrwhk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ar-153245-pumpkin-spice-cupcakes-ddmfs-step01_7624-479f03d5d52c4a449ccb6447fa6cbd92.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/153245/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the pumpkin cupcakes: Sift flour, baking powder, 1 teaspoon cinnamon, nutmeg, ginger, cloves, allspice, baking soda, and salt together in a large bowl. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7zvEZdyYsDjAJEPwigMqVdWm_dw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ar-153245-pumpkin-spice-cupcakes-ddmfs-step02_7626-e5f7fc86672044d49a9ac2f893fe6801.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/153245/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat white sugar, 1/2 cup butter, and brown sugar together in a large bowl with an electric mixer until light and fluffy. Add eggs one at a time, beating well after each addition. Stir in pumpkin puree and milk. Gently mix in flour mixture until just combined. Spoon batter into the prepared muffin cups, filling each 3/4 full.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NARSYyM5yQjDmL71nqQYNfPJZMQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ar-153245-pumpkin-spice-cupcakes-ddmfs-step03_7631-91b4870226ed4b18bf209e34c6fa7e29.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/153245/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until tops spring back when lightly pressed, about 25 minutes. Cool in the pans for 5 minutes. Transfer to a wire rack and let cool, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lnuR4ydPX7NFE9SCJ5lw3djlmmc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ar-153245-pumpkin-spice-cupcakes-ddmfs-step04_7651-671b4aa27e5148e2af53f47cc127717d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/153245/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the frosting: Beat cream cheese and 1/4 cup butter together in a large bowl with an electric mixer until smooth. Beat in confectioners' sugar, a little at a time, until incorporated. Add vanilla extract and 1 teaspoon ground cinnamon; beat until fluffy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vMAbzcjhfQnV8rh85BMqyZLgHR0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ar-153245-pumpkin-spice-cupcakes-ddmfs-step05_7654-61b16b686e8b4cb48bda1396833792ba.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/153245/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Frost cooled cupcakes with cream cheese frosting.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lflUXc-HWiqAgmuXBrMuqWLFM84=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ar-153245-pumpkin-spice-cupcakes-ddmfs-step06_7656-e973e2c207554d028a1671baa6c69b2c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/153245/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
